==Descripton==
The '''DJ Booth Figurine Nametag''' is a nametag which was meant to be obtained from the [[DJ Booth Figurine]] once it reached its second target, that being 3,000 pre-orders. As it never reached that number of orders, it was never added.

The nametag has, however, been made fully functional despite the fact that it is unlikely to ever make it into the game. Its actual name is also not known as it was not listed anywhere, therefore, it is referred to as '''DJ Booth Figurine Nametag''' on this wiki.

The '''DJ Booth Figurine Nametag''' has blue text with a translucent dark blue outline. Multiple blue squares appear around the text. Blue streaks move along the nametag, starting from the left and moving to the right.



